WEBVTT

00:19.436 --> 00:20.437
It's nice.

00:28.111 --> 00:29.404
Is it okay?

00:31.448 --> 00:32.282
Excuse me?

00:33.491 --> 00:34.951
I meant your drink!

01:26.711 --> 01:27.921
You're crying!

02:04.624 --> 02:07.460
BLOODHOUNDS 2

02:11.172 --> 02:12.507
Last month,

02:12.590 --> 02:17.011
Min-beom had a physical at our clinic,
so we have a baseline for comparison.

02:17.095 --> 02:20.473
His liver enzymes
are over 30 times that baseline.

02:20.557 --> 02:22.058
-Thirty times?
-Yes.

02:22.142 --> 02:23.726
He is in critical condition.

02:23.810 --> 02:25.770
This can't be caused by alcohol.

02:26.396 --> 02:29.440
I'd like to tentatively suggest

02:30.608 --> 02:32.819
that there might be drugs in his system.

02:32.902 --> 02:34.279
What kind of drug?

02:34.362 --> 02:38.074
We'll know
once all the test results are back.

02:38.158 --> 02:42.537
The best way to confirm
is to secure a sample of his drink.

02:44.998 --> 02:47.167
When do you expect him to recover?

02:48.168 --> 02:51.379
At this point, it's unclear if he will.

02:52.297 --> 02:53.631
In the worst case,

02:54.549 --> 02:56.342
he may need a liver transplant.

03:09.981 --> 03:11.191
WILL WEE EVR MEET?

03:11.274 --> 03:12.275
HOW ARE THE BOYS?

03:15.904 --> 03:18.323
DU-YEONG, IT'S BEEN A WHILE
SINCE WE LAST TALKED

03:23.077 --> 03:24.954
DID SOMETHING HAPPEN TO THE BOYS?

03:28.958 --> 03:32.754
THEY'RE OKAY FOR NOW

03:39.594 --> 03:42.972
LET ME KNOW RIGHT AWAY
IF ANYTHING HAPPENS

04:04.535 --> 04:05.662
-Mr. Min.
-Hello.

04:06.621 --> 04:08.539
How is President Hong?

04:09.374 --> 04:11.125
It's not looking good.

04:11.209 --> 04:12.043
Oh dear.

04:12.543 --> 04:14.087
I will pray for his recovery.

04:14.170 --> 04:15.880
Thank you very much. Yes.

04:16.547 --> 04:17.966
-Let's go.
-Okay.

04:45.576 --> 04:46.619
Do you know her?

04:47.120 --> 04:49.289
I've never seen her before.

04:53.042 --> 04:54.836
Whoa, hey.

04:55.420 --> 04:56.629
Are you sure about that?

04:57.380 --> 04:59.757
I swear I've never seen her.

05:06.306 --> 05:07.640
Excuse me.

05:08.141 --> 05:13.688
When she kissed me,
a thin plastic film slid into my mouth.

05:14.522 --> 05:17.066
Then I suddenly got dizzy,
my legs gave out,

05:17.150 --> 05:19.193
and I collapsed onto the floor.

05:19.777 --> 05:20.862
And right here,

05:20.945 --> 05:25.992
she squeezed some kind of liquid
into my mouth.

05:26.909 --> 05:29.454
And she asked me questions.

05:30.204 --> 05:31.122
What questions?

05:32.332 --> 05:33.916
I can't remember.

05:35.460 --> 05:40.340
You kind of started talking
without even realizing it, right?

05:42.008 --> 05:43.634
Yes, something like that.

05:43.718 --> 05:45.219
Oh my.

05:45.303 --> 05:46.596
Why? What is it?

05:46.679 --> 05:49.599
It's called a truth serum.

05:49.682 --> 05:51.017
If you take it,

05:51.684 --> 05:53.478
it lowers your inhibitions

05:53.561 --> 05:56.439
and makes you talk about
everything on your mind.

05:56.522 --> 06:01.319
I heard it's used for dates and stuff.

06:01.402 --> 06:02.737
Like narcotics?

06:02.820 --> 06:04.155
Probably.

06:04.238 --> 06:06.574
Is it like a drug
used to force a confession?

06:07.075 --> 06:08.368
I would think so.

06:18.503 --> 06:19.712
She's a smart one.

06:21.255 --> 06:23.341
Did you know
Min-beom was coming here today?

06:23.925 --> 06:25.927
Yes, the booking was made last week.

06:26.010 --> 06:27.053
By whom?

06:27.136 --> 06:28.638
His secretary.

06:32.266 --> 06:34.852
Go to the hospital for a blood draw.

06:34.936 --> 06:36.187
Then call me later.

06:36.270 --> 06:37.355
Do you have my number?

06:37.438 --> 06:39.357
-Yes, you gave it to me last time.
-Okay.

06:39.440 --> 06:41.025
Shall we all have a talk?

06:44.070 --> 06:48.032
Only Secretary Cho and the bartender
knew Min-beom was coming here today.

06:48.116 --> 06:50.910
But I don't think the bartender did it.

06:51.702 --> 06:52.787
For now,

06:53.788 --> 06:55.748
Gun-woo and I'll go see the secretary.

06:56.332 --> 06:59.293
Gwang-mu, could you track down that woman?

06:59.961 --> 07:03.005
She might be operating
where young people hang out.

07:03.089 --> 07:04.924
That might be more up your alley.

07:05.007 --> 07:06.008
Okay.

07:06.717 --> 07:10.680
-Be careful. She's got the hands of a pro.
-Mr. Min, I'm a pro too.

07:11.931 --> 07:13.224
-Gang-yong.
-Yes?

07:13.307 --> 07:15.393
Can I go with Mr. Moon instead?

07:16.018 --> 07:16.853
Why?

07:16.936 --> 07:18.646
If Woo-jin goes with Mr. Moon,

07:18.729 --> 07:20.481
he might use his hand.

07:23.860 --> 07:25.111
Is that okay, Gwang-mu?

07:25.194 --> 07:27.196
Yes, that would be better.

07:29.031 --> 07:30.575
-Then let's move.
-Okay.

07:30.658 --> 07:32.160
-Let's go, Gun-woo.
-Okay.

07:33.870 --> 07:35.204
Excuse me, Mr. Min.

07:35.997 --> 07:37.915
I think this is President Hong's coat.

07:59.770 --> 08:01.230
Are you ready, Gun-woo?

08:01.731 --> 08:02.565
I am.

08:03.316 --> 08:05.818
That's so nice to hear.

08:07.069 --> 08:08.279
-Mr. Moon.
-Yeah?

08:08.905 --> 08:10.448
I'll protect you.

08:10.531 --> 08:12.700
That's so reassuring.

08:13.201 --> 08:16.204
Is this the perk
of running with the champion?

08:24.462 --> 08:26.547
Well, off we go too.

08:29.383 --> 08:32.178
NO CALLER ID

08:33.763 --> 08:37.225
Answer it, but don't say anything first.

08:48.402 --> 08:49.403
Is the chaebol okay?

08:53.991 --> 08:54.992
You…

08:56.285 --> 08:58.079
What did you put in his drink?

08:58.621 --> 09:01.916
You still don't get it,
you fucking bastard.

09:02.708 --> 09:04.961
Fight me, or you're fucked.

09:05.044 --> 09:07.213
I'll chop off your coach's hand,

09:07.713 --> 09:11.300
rip out your mother's tongue,
and force her into a brothel overseas.

09:11.384 --> 09:12.218
Damn it.

09:12.301 --> 09:15.888
As for the chaebol's cousin,
I'll melt his face off with acid.

09:17.014 --> 09:18.432
Make an enemy of me,

09:18.516 --> 09:21.060
and every money-hungry fucker
becomes your enemy too.

09:21.143 --> 09:24.522
How do you think I killed
that cop you saw stabbed to death?

09:25.231 --> 09:28.359
A rat from the same precinct
sold him out for 50 million won.

09:30.778 --> 09:31.862
Gun-woo.

09:32.947 --> 09:35.032
Money buys everything.

09:35.533 --> 09:38.160
I'll give you the money I promised.

09:38.786 --> 09:40.121
Just give me one fight.

09:41.789 --> 09:42.665
Damn it.

09:49.755 --> 09:51.591
KIM GUN-WOO

09:52.883 --> 09:54.385
Fine, fuck it.

09:54.885 --> 09:57.305
In three days, your coach loses his hand.

09:57.805 --> 09:59.056
Your mom will be next.

09:59.640 --> 10:00.558
Just wait.

10:10.735 --> 10:12.570
I'm familiar with these pricks.

10:13.571 --> 10:15.531
They bleed people dry,

10:15.615 --> 10:19.160
and even sell their organs,
those beastly bastards.

10:20.536 --> 10:23.039
Gun-woo. To take down a beast,

10:24.332 --> 10:26.000
you should become fearless.

10:26.083 --> 10:29.295
Show an inch of weakness,
and these bastards will pounce.

10:29.378 --> 10:30.254
You hear me?

10:31.088 --> 10:32.173
What should I do?

10:32.673 --> 10:34.925
To take down a beast…

10:38.179 --> 10:40.097
you must be more beastly than the beast.

10:40.181 --> 10:43.643
I told you
to turn your heart into cast iron.

10:43.726 --> 10:46.479
When your heart is iron,
your fist becomes a blade.

10:46.562 --> 10:47.980
Then you stab him.

10:48.522 --> 10:52.193
With pricks like these,
you have to finish them off. Otherwise…

10:54.612 --> 10:56.364
your family pays the price.

11:09.960 --> 11:10.836
Hello.

11:11.420 --> 11:12.338
Yes.

11:14.340 --> 11:15.174
Won-yeong.

11:16.634 --> 11:18.260
Min-beom got hurt.

11:25.434 --> 11:26.435
Let's get inside.

11:34.527 --> 11:35.778
Do you have a reservation?

11:35.861 --> 11:38.489
-We're here to see the owner.
-Just a moment.

11:38.572 --> 11:40.533
Party of two coming in.

11:40.616 --> 11:41.951
-Go ahead.
-Thanks.

11:42.034 --> 11:44.412
-I'm not going.
-Go home already, girls.

11:44.495 --> 11:46.789
It's a heart. That's insane!

11:46.872 --> 11:47.707
Gwang-mu!

11:48.290 --> 11:49.375
-Gwang-mu!
-Hi.

11:49.458 --> 11:51.168
What brings you all the way here?

11:51.252 --> 11:53.254
Look at that necklace.

11:53.337 --> 11:55.131
-Is it your mom's?
-Pretty, huh?

11:55.214 --> 11:56.882
-Good grief.
-So what's up?

11:56.966 --> 11:59.385
I'm looking for someone.

11:59.468 --> 12:00.594
Who? Is he gay?

12:00.678 --> 12:01.637
It's a woman.

12:03.389 --> 12:04.640
Why come here, then?

12:05.349 --> 12:07.935
Hey, hands to yourself. Have fun, okay?

12:08.018 --> 12:10.271
You know everyone in this area.

12:10.354 --> 12:13.232
How about lowering my interest a bit?

12:13.315 --> 12:14.650
You little devil.

12:14.734 --> 12:16.736
-Please.
-It's up to you.

12:16.819 --> 12:19.155
You know I'm good.

12:19.238 --> 12:20.656
Who is she? Let me see.

12:24.910 --> 12:26.537
Hey, let's go to the back room.

12:27.246 --> 12:28.330
-Follow me.
-Okay.

12:29.039 --> 12:30.666
-Hey, Gun-woo.
-Yes?

12:30.750 --> 12:32.877
-You can't be out here alone.
-Okay.

12:34.128 --> 12:37.965
When I got here,
I told you Min-beom got hurt.

12:38.048 --> 12:40.676
But you didn't even ask how he was doing.

12:42.970 --> 12:45.347
Why did you sell him out
to those bastards?

12:47.600 --> 12:52.354
You went to college on a scholarship
from the Iil Group Foundation.

12:53.397 --> 12:55.065
That was Min-beom's decision.

12:55.149 --> 12:57.401
He hired you as his secretary, okay?

12:57.902 --> 13:00.863
What didn't he do for you? Tell me!

13:00.946 --> 13:03.949
You bastard.
Did you need more money or what?

13:04.533 --> 13:05.367
Hey.

13:07.328 --> 13:09.246
Right now, that poor bastard is…

13:11.207 --> 13:12.917
He can't even open his eyes.

13:14.668 --> 13:17.129
How could you
stab him in the back like that?

13:17.213 --> 13:18.798
Cho Won-yeong!

13:20.841 --> 13:22.384
Is this how low you'll go?

13:27.389 --> 13:28.849
-Don't yell at him.
-Hye-seon.

13:28.933 --> 13:29.892
-Go inside.
-Stop it!

13:29.975 --> 13:30.893
Go inside. Now!

13:30.976 --> 13:32.812
It wasn't your fault!

13:36.148 --> 13:37.149
Look.

13:38.192 --> 13:40.194
Those bastards cut me like this.

13:40.277 --> 13:41.278
Go inside, Hye-seon.

13:41.362 --> 13:42.488
Won-yeong.

13:43.489 --> 13:44.657
Tell me what happened.

13:45.157 --> 13:48.035
You have to tell me
so I can keep you safe.

13:49.286 --> 13:50.538
I'll take care of it.

13:51.121 --> 13:51.956
It's okay.

13:53.916 --> 13:54.750
It's okay.

13:55.835 --> 13:57.461
Have a seat and tell me, please.

13:58.963 --> 14:00.005
Well?

14:03.717 --> 14:06.512
It's too grainy to tell,
and she's so basic.

14:07.388 --> 14:10.099
Come on, take a closer look.

14:10.182 --> 14:12.726
With this?
How do you expect me to do that?

14:12.810 --> 14:15.062
You should lower
that interest rate for me.

14:15.145 --> 14:18.065
At least tell me something
before you haggle.

14:18.148 --> 14:19.859
You tell me something.

14:19.942 --> 14:22.027
There is nothing to work with here.

14:24.446 --> 14:28.200
You know that drug?
The stuff that makes you spill your guts…

14:28.784 --> 14:29.743
It's Truth Game.

14:29.827 --> 14:30.995
That's what it's called?

14:31.078 --> 14:32.538
Yes, Truth Game.

14:33.247 --> 14:37.418
That girl slipped something to the waiter.
I think it was that drug.

14:39.503 --> 14:42.172
You'll have to lower
that interest for me now.

14:42.256 --> 14:45.217
You remembered something, didn't you?

14:46.302 --> 14:47.720
-There is this guy.
-Yeah.

14:47.803 --> 14:50.306
He smuggles it into the country.

14:50.389 --> 14:52.725
Where is that punk now?

14:54.810 --> 14:57.521
-Lower that interest by 5%?
-Forget it, you little thief.

14:57.605 --> 14:59.607
-Just this once, please!
-Stop it.

14:59.690 --> 15:00.774
-Help me.
-Let go.

15:00.858 --> 15:02.776
-Please, just this once.
-Damn it.

15:02.860 --> 15:04.987
-Just this once.
-Fine, 5% it is!

15:06.488 --> 15:08.032
-Hey, call him now.
-Yes, sir.

15:08.574 --> 15:09.783
Give me one minute.

15:10.284 --> 15:11.452
He's just a friend.

15:12.036 --> 15:13.078
I see.

15:13.162 --> 15:14.914
-I'm serious.
-Okay.

15:16.123 --> 15:20.628
I was coming home after buying some beer
at the convenience store.

15:21.128 --> 15:23.923
A hand forced its way in
as I closed the door.

15:24.924 --> 15:25.758
Yes.

15:26.425 --> 15:28.510
Those bastards kicked me

15:29.511 --> 15:30.846
in the stomach.

15:31.555 --> 15:33.641
Then they tied me to a chair.

15:34.934 --> 15:36.143
If I screamed,

15:37.019 --> 15:40.230
they said they'd melt my face with acid.

15:42.191 --> 15:43.025
Now…

15:43.692 --> 15:45.653
-Do you remember their faces?
-Sir.

15:46.654 --> 15:49.281
I think I can take it from here.

15:49.782 --> 15:51.325
Can she be excused?

15:54.370 --> 15:55.245
Thank you.

15:55.746 --> 15:56.580
Go inside.

16:05.839 --> 16:07.549
What did they do to her hand?

16:08.175 --> 16:10.177
They rubbed some kind of ointment on it

16:11.512 --> 16:12.972
before slicing it open.

16:15.349 --> 16:17.351
Maybe a numbing agent. She felt no pain.

16:18.644 --> 16:20.437
What did they look like?

16:21.438 --> 16:23.107
There were three of them.

16:24.858 --> 16:26.735
The big guy had

16:27.236 --> 16:29.613
large eyes with a deep eyelid crease.

16:29.697 --> 16:31.156
And he was strong.

16:32.366 --> 16:34.410
The one who did all the talking

16:35.869 --> 16:37.413
had thick eyebrows

16:39.206 --> 16:40.582
and knew exactly

16:41.291 --> 16:43.502
how to get inside my head.

16:44.086 --> 16:44.920
And?

16:45.629 --> 16:48.424
The man who cut my sister's hand

16:49.341 --> 16:52.678
was gaunt, with a receding hairline

16:53.804 --> 16:55.431
and an odd look in his eyes.

16:56.890 --> 16:58.434
He looked like a junkie.

17:00.978 --> 17:03.981
Did those three seem tight?

17:04.565 --> 17:06.608
They barely talked to each other.

17:06.692 --> 17:09.361
But they worked like a well-oiled machine.

17:10.487 --> 17:11.321
Anything else?

17:13.115 --> 17:14.742
They asked if you were

17:15.367 --> 17:16.785
President Hong's relative.

17:18.787 --> 17:20.956
Those bastards did their research.

17:22.666 --> 17:23.500
And…

17:26.628 --> 17:28.172
It's okay. Go on.

17:30.924 --> 17:33.010
I also told them

17:34.595 --> 17:36.138
where Gun-woo and Woo-jin were staying.

17:42.144 --> 17:44.063
-Should I call them now?
-No.

17:45.105 --> 17:46.857
If they make a move first,

17:47.691 --> 17:49.193
it will compromise Won-yeong.

17:49.777 --> 17:52.154
We need to protect him.
For more reasons than one.

17:52.237 --> 17:55.199
I'll tell Mr. Joo
to put more boots on the ground.

17:56.033 --> 17:56.867
It's even better.

17:57.576 --> 17:59.286
We can nab them if they show up.

17:59.787 --> 18:02.331
The guys in Security Team 3 are all elite.

18:02.831 --> 18:04.583
They said that if I talked,

18:05.334 --> 18:06.668
they'd kill my whole family--

18:06.752 --> 18:07.711
Won-yeong.

18:07.795 --> 18:09.213
Don't worry.

18:09.755 --> 18:11.924
I'll assign more undercover cops

18:12.424 --> 18:14.218
to your sister and this house.

18:14.718 --> 18:17.387
Tell her to act normally
for her own safety.

18:18.847 --> 18:20.182
I'm really sorry.

18:20.766 --> 18:22.810
If they'd done that to my kids,

18:24.394 --> 18:25.896
I would've done the same.

18:26.772 --> 18:27.856
It's not your fault.

18:28.357 --> 18:30.317
Our family is our weak spot.

18:32.486 --> 18:33.779
President Hong…

18:34.822 --> 18:36.073
Is he all right?

18:36.657 --> 18:37.616
Now you ask?

18:38.659 --> 18:39.785
I'm sorry.

18:41.161 --> 18:42.955
LEE WOO-JEONG
CLASS 39

18:43.539 --> 18:44.665
Just pray, will you?

18:46.125 --> 18:47.376
Hello, Woo-jeong.

18:52.464 --> 18:54.216
He has arrived.

18:57.511 --> 18:58.554
What's wrong with him?

19:01.056 --> 19:02.558
You are Kim Gun-woo.

19:03.392 --> 19:04.226
I am.

19:05.018 --> 19:06.937
-See?
-I'm a huge fan!

19:07.020 --> 19:09.606
Don't you remember me?

19:11.692 --> 19:13.318
You dropped Hong Jong-min

19:13.402 --> 19:17.531
with a left body shot
and signed this for me.

19:19.324 --> 19:21.076
TO JANG JUN
THANK YOU, KIM GUN-WOO

19:21.785 --> 19:23.954
That's right. I remember!

19:24.037 --> 19:25.455
Yes, that was me!

19:25.539 --> 19:26.415
Right, hello.

19:27.499 --> 19:29.918
Nice to meet you again.

19:30.002 --> 19:31.628
It's such an honor.

19:34.047 --> 19:35.632
Thank you. Is this for real?

19:35.716 --> 19:37.176
I'm so happy for you.

19:37.259 --> 19:40.220
By the way, what can I do for you?

19:40.304 --> 19:42.639
Kim Gun-woo

19:43.140 --> 19:45.142
is desperately looking for this lady.

19:45.225 --> 19:46.226
Have you seen her?

19:46.310 --> 19:48.770
That's Gi-na.

19:49.271 --> 19:50.272
Yeah, I know her.

19:50.355 --> 19:52.900
We sort of had a romantic thing going on…

19:53.400 --> 19:55.527
Did you sell her the Truth Game?

19:55.611 --> 19:57.362
I sure did.

19:57.446 --> 19:59.656
Where do you think she is?

20:01.533 --> 20:02.826
-Thank you.
-Sure.

20:03.327 --> 20:04.411
Have a good night.

20:05.871 --> 20:07.789
Mr. Min, this is Moon Gwang-mu.

20:08.290 --> 20:09.625
What's the situation?

20:09.708 --> 20:13.253
I tracked her down. Her name is Gi-na.

20:13.337 --> 20:16.465
I'm going to the gambling den
where she works.

20:17.090 --> 20:19.676
Really? That's wonderful.

20:20.177 --> 20:22.262
You put your faith in me.

20:22.346 --> 20:24.514
I can't let you down, can I?

20:24.598 --> 20:27.851
Maybe you could help me out
with my investigation later.

20:27.935 --> 20:29.144
I'd be honored.

20:29.228 --> 20:33.607
You know, my dream was to become
a homicide detective.

20:34.233 --> 20:36.360
Let's meet up and talk it through,

20:36.443 --> 20:37.986
and then we'll move out together.

20:38.487 --> 20:40.822
Sounds good. Where should I wait?

20:41.323 --> 20:44.284
Can you head over
to Gun-woo and Woo-jin's hotel?

20:44.368 --> 20:48.163
One of my guys found a lead
based on that photo you gave me.

20:49.289 --> 20:50.415
Really?

20:51.083 --> 20:53.585
Okay, I'll see you there.

20:53.669 --> 20:55.087
Yes, see you soon.

21:12.479 --> 21:13.397
Come on in.

21:14.273 --> 21:17.401
Everyone, I'd like you
to meet Lee Woo-jeong.

21:17.484 --> 21:19.444
He's our team's newest investigator.

21:21.446 --> 21:23.991
Hello, nice to meet you.

21:24.700 --> 21:27.244
At my alma mater,
there is the Green Pine Tree Club.

21:27.327 --> 21:29.413
It means to remain evergreen like a pine,

21:29.496 --> 21:32.499
upholding justice and equality
in our society.

21:32.582 --> 21:34.376
It was started by our seniors.

21:34.459 --> 21:36.753
It's a secret society
for the top of the class.

21:36.837 --> 21:38.505
I met him there.

21:39.214 --> 21:42.426
Meet Tae-yeong. She used to be
with the Cyber Investigation Division.

21:42.509 --> 21:43.802
Nice to meet you.

21:50.350 --> 21:53.270
It's an honor to meet a CID legend.

21:55.272 --> 21:58.442
I'm not a boxer,
but I'm a huge fan of the sport.

21:58.525 --> 22:01.361
I've been following you
since the Rookies during the pandemic.

22:01.445 --> 22:02.529
Thank you.

22:02.612 --> 22:05.073
Moon Gwang-mu here. It's an honor.

22:05.157 --> 22:06.241
The honor is mine.

22:06.325 --> 22:08.577
This is the first time
I'm meeting a top student.

22:08.660 --> 22:10.037
Hey, you've met me.

22:11.747 --> 22:12.748
The second, then.

22:13.707 --> 22:14.541
Seriously.

22:20.297 --> 22:22.841
What was your name again?

22:24.843 --> 22:26.428
I'm Hong Woo-jin.

22:27.929 --> 22:30.682
I was in that same Rookies Tournament
you watched.

22:31.183 --> 22:33.185
I'm sorry, I…

22:37.356 --> 22:38.607
So, Woo-jeong.

22:39.191 --> 22:41.902
Does the "Woo" in your name
mean "to help"?

22:42.986 --> 22:45.280
It actually means "to excel."

22:46.865 --> 22:48.200
Mine means "to help."

22:48.283 --> 22:53.497
I hope we get to know each other
and help each other.

22:53.997 --> 22:57.334
Sure. Next time we meet,
I'll say hello first.

22:57.417 --> 23:00.128
Does your name "woo" also mean "to help"?

23:01.088 --> 23:03.256
-Mine means "friend."
-I see.

23:03.340 --> 23:07.677
Should we also start
a society like the Green Pine Tree Club?

23:08.512 --> 23:11.973
Three different Woos unite
and move forward.

23:12.474 --> 23:14.476
How about Three Woo Club?

23:16.603 --> 23:18.230
I love that idea.

23:18.313 --> 23:20.399
Long live the Three Woo Club, okay?

23:20.482 --> 23:22.818
But Woo-jin, can we get to work?

23:22.901 --> 23:24.319
-Yes, sir.
-Good.

23:27.489 --> 23:29.116
OCTO ROMA NATURALIA CASE FILE

23:29.199 --> 23:31.827
I'll start the brief on the case report.

23:35.205 --> 23:38.166
The watch in the photo you sent us
is a limited edition.

23:38.667 --> 23:41.128
Only two people in Korea
bought this watch.

23:41.628 --> 23:45.048
A professional soccer player in Europe,
and the other is

23:46.216 --> 23:47.426
a man named Yun Tae-geom.

23:48.135 --> 23:49.219
That's the bastard.

23:50.387 --> 23:51.513
Is that him?

23:52.472 --> 23:53.432
Yes, we fought him.

23:55.600 --> 23:57.644
Yun Tae-geom, born in 1990.

23:58.603 --> 24:01.898
In March 2009, he enlisted as
a Class 179 NCO, Special Warfare Command.

24:01.982 --> 24:05.777
He served in the 17th SF Brigade,
specializing in explosives.

24:05.861 --> 24:08.989
His squadmate says
he was a brainiac with nimble hands

24:09.072 --> 24:11.283
who was a natural at cooking up IEDs.

24:11.366 --> 24:14.286
In April 2020,
he was dishonorably discharged.

24:14.786 --> 24:16.872
It's classified
and yet to be confirmed. I…

24:18.373 --> 24:20.208
checked his Family Relations Certificate.

24:20.292 --> 24:21.668
SPOUSE: HAN EUN-JI, DECEASED
CHILD: YUN MIN-A

24:21.751 --> 24:23.420
He has a young daughter.

24:24.379 --> 24:25.213
Where is she?

24:25.297 --> 24:28.842
She's in Daejeon with her grandmother.
I'm still probing the wife's case.

24:28.925 --> 24:31.052
Where is Yun Tae-geom now?

24:32.179 --> 24:35.515
On paper, he went to Thailand last year
and hasn't returned since.

24:35.599 --> 24:39.102
I think he reentered the country
on a forged passport.

24:39.936 --> 24:42.272
Okay, can we gather here for a second?

24:42.355 --> 24:43.440
-Yes.
-Okay.

24:51.072 --> 24:52.574
This is the head.

24:53.325 --> 24:54.326
And this is

24:54.826 --> 24:55.660
Yun Tae-geom.

24:55.744 --> 24:58.413
He's Special Forces,
the fixer, and the muscle.

24:58.497 --> 24:59.831
This is Kang In-beom.

25:00.332 --> 25:03.752
It's unclear what role
this next bastard plays.

25:03.835 --> 25:05.754
But Secretary Cho says he is…

25:05.837 --> 25:06.963
A yap?

25:07.047 --> 25:08.798
Yes, that's the vibe.

25:08.882 --> 25:11.218
Let's first go over what we know.

25:11.301 --> 25:13.512
This is the junkie doctor.

25:13.595 --> 25:16.890
Perhaps this bastard cooked up
the drug used on Min-beom.

25:17.599 --> 25:20.268
Thick eyebrows here is likely the broker,

25:20.352 --> 25:23.063
hiring thugs, strategizing,
and gathering intel.

25:23.563 --> 25:27.776
He probably orchestrated Kang's jailbreak.
He preps whatever they need.

25:27.859 --> 25:29.986
Sir, there's a sixth one.
The computer whiz.

25:32.822 --> 25:36.076
They've got a crowd.
That payroll must be huge.

25:36.576 --> 25:37.619
Gang-yong.

25:37.702 --> 25:40.413
I was waiting to tell you in person.

25:40.914 --> 25:43.250
In front of Golden Slumber earlier,

25:44.751 --> 25:45.835
I got a call.

25:47.629 --> 25:49.506
-On your cell?
-Yes.

25:50.006 --> 25:50.882
What did he say?

25:50.966 --> 25:56.054
It was a threat. Fight in their league,
or they would hurt everyone around him.

25:56.137 --> 25:57.931
The phone number was

25:58.431 --> 25:59.641
probably restricted.

26:00.225 --> 26:01.768
Did he say anything else?

26:02.561 --> 26:03.395
Gun-woo.

26:06.189 --> 26:08.191
About the detective
who died in front of us,

26:09.693 --> 26:14.155
someone from his own station
sold him out for 50 million won.

26:22.914 --> 26:25.917
Let's keep our circle small.
Just between us, okay?

26:26.751 --> 26:27.669
Yes.

26:29.504 --> 26:31.923
In a sense,

26:32.007 --> 26:35.594
they're more intelligent and specialized
than Kim Myeong-gil's crew.

26:35.677 --> 26:39.389
But there's no need to chicken out.
Justice is on our side.

26:40.890 --> 26:44.686
We have a few tasks,
but they need to happen all at once.

26:44.769 --> 26:48.356
Gwang-mu and Gun-woo,
please go see that woman.

26:48.440 --> 26:49.733
-Okay.
-Okay.

26:49.816 --> 26:53.445
Woo-jeong, trace the bastard
who stabbed Detective Choi. Pull the CCTV.

26:53.528 --> 26:54.404
Will do.

26:54.487 --> 26:56.906
Woo-jin, let's go meet
Yun Tae-geom's mother.

26:56.990 --> 26:58.241
-Understood.
-Okay.

26:58.325 --> 26:59.826
Monitor the site.

26:59.909 --> 27:02.746
If you find anything on him,
contact me immediately.

27:02.829 --> 27:04.372
This bastard bribed a cop.

27:04.956 --> 27:06.666
I don't know what he used to do.

27:06.750 --> 27:08.168
He's quick and connected.

27:08.752 --> 27:11.171
Perhaps he was a cop.

27:11.755 --> 27:12.589
I see.

27:12.672 --> 27:14.799
Everyone, be safe.

27:15.300 --> 27:17.093
-Woo-jin.
-Here.

27:20.764 --> 27:22.849
-One, two, three.
-Let's do this!

27:52.629 --> 27:55.757
Which camera shows
his direction of travel?

27:55.840 --> 27:57.175
-One moment.
-Sure.

27:57.258 --> 27:59.427
The bottom feed is our best bet.

28:23.201 --> 28:24.619
I'll give you a sedative.

28:26.371 --> 28:29.249
It'll make you feel more comfortable.

28:29.332 --> 28:30.458
No!

28:31.042 --> 28:33.586
I'm doing this on my own!

28:33.670 --> 28:36.172
You may require a liver transplant.

28:36.256 --> 28:37.549
You need to get the shot.

28:37.632 --> 28:38.925
-Or--
-On my own, damn it!

28:39.008 --> 28:40.802
You're putting yourself in danger!

28:40.885 --> 28:41.970
I'll pull through.

28:42.470 --> 28:43.972
Watch me!

29:18.173 --> 29:19.591
-Gang-yong.
-Yeah?

29:19.674 --> 29:20.800
What are you doing?

29:22.469 --> 29:24.971
Woo-jin, do you know how much this costs?

29:25.930 --> 29:28.099
I don't know. About 30,000 won?

29:30.351 --> 29:31.603
Are you kidding?

29:33.104 --> 29:33.938
How much is it?

29:34.022 --> 29:35.690
This costs 250,000 won.

29:36.691 --> 29:37.650
What?

29:37.734 --> 29:40.945
You have to line up at Shinsegae Gangnam
for one of these.

29:44.657 --> 29:45.533
Gang-yong.

29:45.617 --> 29:46.785
Yeah?

29:46.868 --> 29:49.996
Now I know why you brought me here.

29:51.498 --> 29:52.332
Why?

29:52.415 --> 29:56.169
You want me to cozy up
to Yun Tae-geom's mother and work her

29:56.669 --> 29:59.464
so we can get to him in person, right?

29:59.547 --> 30:02.133
I've got this.

30:05.261 --> 30:08.973
Clearly, you're overestimating yourself.

30:11.601 --> 30:13.686
You're talking to the kid.

30:14.187 --> 30:16.689
I'm talking to the mother.

30:19.317 --> 30:21.653
-Understood.
-Good.

30:25.573 --> 30:26.783
Who is it?

30:27.659 --> 30:29.202
-Hello, ma'am.
-Yes?

30:29.285 --> 30:32.622
Could I speak to you for a moment?

30:36.125 --> 30:36.960
Okay.

30:39.045 --> 30:40.338
Two years ago,

30:41.422 --> 30:44.509
he left the country,
saying he'd taken a job in Thailand.

30:44.592 --> 30:46.886
He said he'd run security for a VIP there.

30:47.887 --> 30:49.556
I haven't seen him since.

30:50.139 --> 30:51.599
Not even on the holidays?

30:52.600 --> 30:53.434
No.

30:55.854 --> 30:58.231
Min-a must really miss her dad.

31:00.692 --> 31:02.652
Do you not keep in touch with him?

31:05.405 --> 31:06.239
No.

31:08.491 --> 31:10.159
He must miss his daughter.

31:10.660 --> 31:13.204
I have a daughter just about Min-a's age.

31:13.288 --> 31:17.542
I don't know what he's up to.

31:19.043 --> 31:20.628
I don't want to know.

31:31.055 --> 31:32.390
Good job.

31:33.600 --> 31:38.146
Hey, Min-a.
He's eating all your snacks, huh?

31:47.322 --> 31:50.658
Min-a, can we stop drawing

31:50.742 --> 31:52.201
and do something else?

31:52.869 --> 31:55.872
Let's play with stickers.
I have lots in my room.

31:55.955 --> 31:58.124
Okay, let's go.

31:59.250 --> 32:00.293
Good girl.

32:06.716 --> 32:09.010
So why did her dad leave the military?

32:09.844 --> 32:11.804
Military pay wasn't enough

32:13.222 --> 32:14.933
to cover her mom's hospital bills.

32:16.601 --> 32:17.644
What was her diagnosis?

32:21.314 --> 32:22.523
It was cancer.

32:23.733 --> 32:24.734
Pancreatic cancer.

32:28.488 --> 32:30.198
That must have been so difficult.

32:32.116 --> 32:32.951
Min-a.

32:34.077 --> 32:38.748
Is it okay to waste
all your heart stickers on me?

32:38.831 --> 32:39.666
Yup.

32:40.249 --> 32:44.879
If you put the stickers on your dad,
wouldn't he like that?

32:44.963 --> 32:47.256
I put 100 stickers on him.

32:47.340 --> 32:48.758
When?

32:49.509 --> 32:50.927
Three nights ago.

32:52.428 --> 32:54.097
I see.

32:54.847 --> 32:56.224
Three nights ago, huh?

33:00.478 --> 33:03.815
Then three nights ago,

33:03.898 --> 33:06.734
your dad gave you the scooter, right?

33:07.318 --> 33:08.152
Yes.

33:08.778 --> 33:10.530
How was the ride?

33:11.823 --> 33:13.992
I was too scared to try.

33:20.373 --> 33:23.626
Do you want me to teach you how?

33:24.252 --> 33:25.128
Yes!

33:25.211 --> 33:26.254
Let's go.

33:27.714 --> 33:29.048
Let's go.

33:30.216 --> 33:33.428
Grandma, I'm going
to ride the scooter with him.

33:33.511 --> 33:36.806
I'll make sure
she rides safely and stays careful.

33:37.306 --> 33:38.808
See you later, Grandma.

33:38.891 --> 33:39.934
Be safe.

33:40.018 --> 33:40.852
Of course.

33:44.355 --> 33:45.189
Let's go.

33:49.318 --> 33:50.278
Ma'am.

33:52.405 --> 33:54.282
We already know the truth.

33:57.952 --> 33:59.120
If you help us,

33:59.620 --> 34:03.249
I'll help bring your son home.

34:04.292 --> 34:05.126
I promise.

34:14.302 --> 34:17.722
What do I… have to do?

34:18.222 --> 34:19.682
You just have to call me

34:20.183 --> 34:22.310
when he contacts you.

34:25.688 --> 34:27.565
-Show me the next clip.
-Sure.

34:32.945 --> 34:34.238
Please zoom in.

34:55.468 --> 34:56.969
-Hold it there.
-Sure.

35:03.726 --> 35:04.560
Thank you.

35:04.644 --> 35:06.437
-I'll be right back.
-Sure.

35:07.897 --> 35:09.232
Hello, Woo-jeong.

35:11.651 --> 35:12.527
Yes, I can talk.

35:12.610 --> 35:15.530
I've spotted our Number Four on the CCTV.

35:15.613 --> 35:16.531
You did?

35:16.614 --> 35:18.032
Send me his photo.

35:18.116 --> 35:19.408
-Right away, sir.
-Who?

35:19.492 --> 35:20.618
Number Four.

35:20.701 --> 35:21.744
And, Woo-jeong,

35:21.828 --> 35:24.247
I just met Yun Tae-geom's mother.

35:24.330 --> 35:26.290
His wife had pancreatic cancer.

35:26.374 --> 35:28.334
He took out juice loans for her meds,

35:28.417 --> 35:32.255
but they raided the base
when he missed a payment.

35:32.755 --> 35:33.881
Hence, the discharge.

35:34.465 --> 35:35.800
That's tough.

35:35.883 --> 35:38.970
I know. Poor bastard.

35:39.846 --> 35:42.348
If you have his number, I'll track it.

35:42.431 --> 35:45.017
His mom says
he's always switching numbers.

35:45.101 --> 35:46.394
Should we issue a warrant?

35:46.978 --> 35:49.438
I thought about that, too,

35:50.314 --> 35:53.234
but there could be someone
or even people among us

35:53.776 --> 35:54.986
who took their money.

35:55.570 --> 35:58.239
A warrant will trigger
a total scrub of Yun Tae-geom.

35:59.407 --> 36:02.451
Leave aside Secretary Cho and Yun for now.

36:02.535 --> 36:04.662
That way, the intel will flow our way.

36:05.580 --> 36:07.707
Besides, I want to meet this Yun Tae-geom.

36:08.207 --> 36:11.377
Whatever he is,
the bastard works for his family.

36:11.878 --> 36:14.005
We might be able to flip him.

36:14.714 --> 36:15.923
Yes, sir.

36:16.007 --> 36:18.384
Anyway, send me his photo right away.

36:19.010 --> 36:19.844
Yes, sir.

36:21.387 --> 36:23.306
Let's see what the bastard looks like.

36:24.765 --> 36:25.600
HONG MIN-BEOM

36:29.812 --> 36:31.314
Hello, Min-beom.

36:31.814 --> 36:32.690
Where are you?

36:35.067 --> 36:37.278
Woo-jin and I are in Daejeon on a case.

36:37.361 --> 36:38.196
Are you okay?

36:39.572 --> 36:40.698
It's rough.

36:42.283 --> 36:43.993
I'm finally awake and calling you.

36:45.453 --> 36:47.038
Thank God.

36:47.538 --> 36:49.707
We were all so worried about you.

36:53.085 --> 36:54.587
Give me a few days.

36:57.006 --> 36:58.507
I'm not out of the woods yet.

36:58.591 --> 37:00.384
Of course, buddy.

37:00.468 --> 37:01.719
I'm hanging up now.

37:01.802 --> 37:03.804
Of course. Get some rest.

37:08.684 --> 37:10.144
There it is.

37:22.907 --> 37:25.618
I feel like a detective right now.

37:25.701 --> 37:27.703
A bit, yes.

37:28.871 --> 37:30.373
-Jun.
-Yeah.

37:30.456 --> 37:33.542
Are you sure she'll be here?

37:33.626 --> 37:36.337
She usually comes to work around now.

37:36.420 --> 37:38.214
I've dropped her off before.

37:50.977 --> 37:52.812
There she is. That's the one!

38:00.027 --> 38:03.781
When you get off the elevator
on the seventh floor,

38:03.864 --> 38:05.408
there's a long hallway.

38:05.491 --> 38:07.410
If you go down that hallway,

38:07.493 --> 38:10.246
on the left,
you'll see a bunch of cards on--

38:10.329 --> 38:11.330
What is this place?

38:11.414 --> 38:14.208
Well, they play blackjack and mahjong,

38:14.292 --> 38:16.877
but that place
is crawling with dangerous people.

38:16.961 --> 38:18.629
There are goons and thugs,

38:18.713 --> 38:21.382
and I've seen people with knives and axes.

38:21.465 --> 38:23.884
Please be careful, Mr. Kim.

38:24.510 --> 38:26.762
Thank you, Mr. Jang.

38:29.557 --> 38:30.516
Good luck.

38:30.599 --> 38:31.976
Whatever it is.

38:33.185 --> 38:34.020
Thanks.

38:51.871 --> 38:52.955
Mr. Moon.

38:53.456 --> 38:54.915
Mr. Min, this is her.

38:54.999 --> 38:56.042
-She's Gi-na.
-Okay.

38:56.125 --> 38:58.711
She works on the seventh floor.

38:58.794 --> 39:00.421
-Good work.
-Thanks.

39:09.638 --> 39:10.848
This is it.

39:11.474 --> 39:15.019
I was here seven years ago.
A serial killer was hiding here.

39:15.770 --> 39:18.230
It was built in the '70s,
so the layout is different.

39:18.314 --> 39:20.107
See the exit stairs?

39:22.610 --> 39:24.737
She'll either come down this way

39:24.820 --> 39:28.199
or take the elevator to the garage.

39:28.282 --> 39:30.493
I need two people to go in
and lure her out.

39:30.576 --> 39:33.996
One person on the exit stairs
and the other on the central stairs.

39:34.830 --> 39:35.664
Gang-yong.

39:36.707 --> 39:39.210
Can I go in the front with Mr. Moon?

39:41.045 --> 39:42.713
-Are you sure?
-Yes.

39:44.382 --> 39:46.801
I'll take the exit stairs.

39:47.718 --> 39:50.971
Okay, let's be safe out there.

39:51.055 --> 39:52.973
-Woo-jin.
-Here.

39:53.057 --> 39:54.892
-One, two, three.
-Let's do this!

39:54.975 --> 39:55.810
Let's go.

40:22.128 --> 40:23.170
Got your gloves on?

40:28.092 --> 40:29.718
Damn it.

40:40.688 --> 40:41.522
Yes?

40:41.605 --> 40:44.191
Moon, from Dream On Capital.
I'm here to play.

40:47.069 --> 40:48.737
What's with this fucker?

40:50.406 --> 40:51.240
Who?

40:51.323 --> 40:54.160
Jang Jun sent me.
He said this place is fun.

40:54.243 --> 40:55.369
Time's ticking. Open up.

40:57.204 --> 40:58.789
Is he fucking serious?

41:20.978 --> 41:22.062
Here.

41:26.609 --> 41:27.693
Let's see.

41:32.406 --> 41:34.283
-Hey, go get some more chips.
-Huh?

41:35.493 --> 41:38.787
Man, why do I keep getting garbage hands?

41:39.788 --> 41:41.081
Come on!

41:43.584 --> 41:44.877
Final raise.

41:47.588 --> 41:49.507
-Cops!
-What the hell?

41:49.590 --> 41:52.384
-Fuck, the cops are here?
-Cops!

41:52.468 --> 41:53.719
-Damn it!
-Son of a bitch!

41:53.802 --> 41:56.055
Gun-woo, get her! The pink hair!

41:56.555 --> 41:57.765
You bastard!

42:33.676 --> 42:34.927
Gun-woo!

43:03.414 --> 43:04.248
What?

43:20.222 --> 43:21.223
Fuck!

43:38.616 --> 43:39.867
Get off, bastard!

43:53.964 --> 43:55.215
Stop! Hold it!

43:55.299 --> 43:58.927
I'm not a cop. I'm a small business owner.

43:59.011 --> 44:01.305
So what? You fucker!

44:46.725 --> 44:48.519
-Sir, it's me!
-Stop it! Don't!

44:48.602 --> 44:50.020
-Huh?
-Are you okay?

44:51.021 --> 44:52.606
-Yes.
-Are you sure?

44:52.690 --> 44:55.943
Guess I won't die
as long as I stick with you.

44:56.026 --> 44:57.486
She's close. Let's move.

44:57.569 --> 44:59.655
-Okay.
-Man.

45:04.410 --> 45:05.994
Fuck.

45:06.578 --> 45:08.622
-Aren't you coming, Gi-na?
-You go ahead.

45:25.222 --> 45:26.807
Let's go quietly.

45:34.022 --> 45:36.275
Settle down and put the knife away--

45:36.942 --> 45:38.152
Damn it!

45:39.778 --> 45:42.364
Help! Somebody help!

45:49.455 --> 45:50.289
Hello?

45:50.372 --> 45:52.040
-Tae-yeong.
-Yes.

45:52.124 --> 45:54.626
I've got her cell phone. What should I do?

45:54.710 --> 45:55.711
What model is it?

45:55.794 --> 45:58.672
No clue. It's an iPhone,
but I can't tell which model.

45:58.756 --> 46:01.550
iPhones don't need a passcode for photos.

46:01.633 --> 46:05.429
I'm sending you a QR code.
Scan it with her phone.

46:14.730 --> 46:15.898
Got it. Hold on.

46:26.450 --> 46:27.284
GI-NA

46:27.367 --> 46:28.744
MONEY

46:34.958 --> 46:36.376
HOW MUCH

46:36.460 --> 46:37.628
HOW MUCH?
MANJI

46:37.711 --> 46:38.962
GROUP CHAT? WHY NOT DM ME?

46:40.798 --> 46:41.757
IS THE JOB JUICY?

46:41.840 --> 46:42.966
YOUR PRICE PLUS BONUS

46:43.050 --> 46:43.884
LEAVING IT TO YOU

46:43.967 --> 46:44.927
JUST SPIKE A DRINK

46:45.010 --> 46:45.886
USE MY OWN DRUG?

46:45.969 --> 46:47.554
-LET'S TALK IN PERSON.
-WHERE?

46:47.638 --> 46:49.056
I'LL CALL YOU. MEET ME THERE

46:49.139 --> 46:49.973
OKAY

46:51.225 --> 46:52.267
Damn it.

46:53.977 --> 46:54.812
Sir.

46:54.895 --> 46:55.854
What is it?

46:55.938 --> 46:58.106
She put something
in President Hong's drink.

46:58.190 --> 47:00.651
She even met with the person
who ordered the job today.

47:00.734 --> 47:01.902
Where?

47:01.985 --> 47:05.948
Entra Hotel, second-floor bar. At eleven.

47:08.075 --> 47:09.034
Tae-yeong.

47:09.701 --> 47:12.704
Call the hotel
and see if Yun Tae-geom is staying there.

47:15.207 --> 47:17.125
Thank you for calling Entra Hotel.

47:17.793 --> 47:20.128
This is Kang Tae-yeong
with the National Police.

47:20.629 --> 47:23.006
I need the room number
for your guest, Yun Tae-geom.

47:26.009 --> 47:30.639
You must know that noncompliance could
lead to an obstruction of justice charge.

47:32.766 --> 47:35.143
He's a long-term guest in the penthouse.

47:36.395 --> 47:37.688
Thanks for cooperating.

47:38.564 --> 47:40.691
HE'S A LONG-TERM GUEST IN THE PENTHOUSE

47:41.608 --> 47:42.609
We got it.

47:42.693 --> 47:43.777
Gwang-mu.

47:44.486 --> 47:46.280
Please take her somewhere safe.

47:46.363 --> 47:47.447
Will do.

47:47.531 --> 47:49.324
I'll go with him.

47:49.408 --> 47:50.784
-Okay.
-I'll come with you.

49:50.070 --> 49:51.154
Hey.

49:51.238 --> 49:52.531
You said he'd buy it.

49:53.448 --> 49:55.826
Does that look like
a fucking buyer to you?

49:57.911 --> 49:59.371
He's just acting tough.

49:59.454 --> 50:01.289
If we bring Gun-woo, we're good.

50:02.082 --> 50:03.750
Fuck that, you prick.

50:16.471 --> 50:18.557
-What?
-This is the front desk.

50:18.640 --> 50:20.726
Man-bae told me to call

50:20.809 --> 50:22.728
if anything unusual happens.

50:22.811 --> 50:25.230
The police just called the front desk.

51:00.766 --> 51:02.726
SPECIAL OPERATIONS UNIT

51:14.362 --> 51:16.782
Stay inside. We'll take it from here.

53:01.678 --> 53:02.679
Out!

53:37.589 --> 53:40.550
NO CALLER ID

53:42.928 --> 53:44.346
You killed them.

53:45.305 --> 53:46.181
How does it feel?

53:48.058 --> 53:50.060
I told you everyone would be fucked.

53:50.810 --> 53:54.397
I told you one fight was enough,
you son of a bitch!

53:58.526 --> 53:59.778
Why won't you listen?

54:00.946 --> 54:02.739
Your coach's hand is next.

54:03.240 --> 54:04.366
What's your move?

54:06.826 --> 54:08.161
Answer me!

54:13.291 --> 54:14.459
Name your spot.

54:15.460 --> 54:16.336
Good.

54:16.836 --> 54:18.421
Now we're talking.

54:19.214 --> 54:20.840
Wait until I contact you.

57:23.106 --> 57:28.111
Subtitle translation by: Jooyea Lee
